WEBVTT

01:30.566 --> 01:31.551
=Tigers Sniff the Rose=

01:31.551 --> 01:33.560
(Based on the novel of the same name by Yiren Kuikui)

01:35.060 --> 01:38.900
=Episode 2=

01:39.540 --> 01:39.860
(Santu County Office)
Get out!

01:50.220 --> 01:51.860
(Santu County Office)

01:53.380 --> 01:53.660
Go!

01:57.460 --> 01:58.980
(Merit Through the Ages)

02:00.900 --> 02:01.780
(It's him.)

02:05.340 --> 02:07.580
(He's actually still alive.)

02:07.660 --> 02:09.860
(Merit Through the Ages)

02:09.860 --> 02:10.620
May I ask, sir,

02:11.460 --> 02:13.340
what was the name
of the military officer

02:13.820 --> 02:14.660
who just rode by?

02:14.660 --> 02:15.940
What's it to you?

02:16.220 --> 02:17.260
Why are you asking?

02:17.860 --> 02:19.180
When I saw him just now,

02:19.780 --> 02:20.340
I thought

02:21.100 --> 02:22.140
I recognized
an old acquaintance of mine.

02:23.180 --> 02:23.620
An old acquaintance?

02:24.260 --> 02:27.100
Captain Zhang received transfer orders.

02:27.220 --> 02:29.420
He's been promoted and is passing
through here on his way to the capital.

02:29.860 --> 02:31.140
How could he be
an old acquaintance of yours?

02:32.620 --> 02:33.740
Captain Zhang?

02:35.220 --> 02:36.060
His surname is Zhang?

02:36.620 --> 02:37.340
You must've mistaken him.

02:40.340 --> 02:41.500
The last time I saw him,

02:41.780 --> 02:42.980
he was still in the Shence Army.

02:43.620 --> 02:44.300
I never imagined

02:45.100 --> 02:45.660
that now,

02:46.980 --> 02:48.300
he'd have such a bright future.

02:56.260 --> 02:56.980
Sanlang!

02:57.300 --> 02:58.820
Dalang, Shang, run!

03:01.420 --> 03:01.860
Father!

03:07.540 --> 03:08.260
(Xie Jinghui, Yan Shang's Mother)

03:09.260 --> 03:10.260
Jinghui!

03:10.420 --> 03:10.780
Mother!

03:11.260 --> 03:13.220
(Young Yan Shang)

03:20.460 --> 03:21.820
(Come have a look!)

03:22.300 --> 03:24.260
(Candied hawthorns!)

03:24.260 --> 03:25.380
(Come and see!)

03:25.860 --> 03:27.500
(Tasty and affordable!)

03:29.220 --> 03:30.580
(Top quality! Take a look!)

03:33.500 --> 03:34.780
(Meat)
(Come have a look!)

03:34.980 --> 03:37.300
(Finely crafted, sturdy and durable!)

03:37.340 --> 03:37.820
(Take care.)

03:39.980 --> 03:41.140
(Come have a look!)

03:41.140 --> 03:42.500
(Everything's freshly made!)

03:42.740 --> 03:43.940
(Promoted to a post in the capital...)

03:45.860 --> 03:47.140
(So, he's going to Sheng'an.)

03:49.180 --> 03:50.740
(Sheng'an...)

03:51.900 --> 03:53.900
(Shuying Rouge House)
(Ladies, feel free to browse here too.)

03:55.300 --> 03:56.140
(Come have a look!)

03:57.100 --> 03:58.700
This is the most fashionable shade.

03:58.980 --> 04:01.020
Don't apply it all over.
Just dab it on that spot.

04:01.420 --> 04:02.660
What brings a man here?

04:03.340 --> 04:04.060
Don't bother looking.

04:04.420 --> 04:05.780
He's obviously here to buy makeup.

04:06.060 --> 04:07.140
He must already have a wife.

04:08.100 --> 04:10.380
How come other women's husbands
know what to buy?

04:10.980 --> 04:11.780
Sir,

04:12.380 --> 04:13.260
what can I get for you?

04:14.700 --> 04:15.740
Are these all the rouge shades

04:16.140 --> 04:16.780
you have?

04:29.460 --> 04:31.140
You're quite a picky young man.

04:31.580 --> 04:33.100
(Sappan Rouge)
All our shades in storage are here.

04:33.500 --> 04:34.100
You won't find

04:34.100 --> 04:35.620
a wider range of shades anywhere else.

04:54.700 --> 04:55.100
I want this one.

04:55.780 --> 04:57.740
Sir, don't mind me saying so,

04:58.220 --> 05:00.140
but this shade isn't very fashionable.

05:00.700 --> 05:02.500
It sold well a few years ago.

05:02.860 --> 05:04.020
But nowadays...

05:10.340 --> 05:10.620
Here.

05:11.780 --> 05:12.060
Oh...

05:14.220 --> 05:16.540
A box of rouge doesn't cost this much.

05:16.980 --> 05:17.980
I'm not buying this box of rouge.

05:18.660 --> 05:19.380
I just want to know

05:20.020 --> 05:21.060
how rouge in this shade

05:21.620 --> 05:22.420
is made.

05:22.700 --> 05:23.780
Well...

05:25.340 --> 05:26.100
Sir,

05:26.380 --> 05:28.140
don't underestimate women's cosmetics.

05:28.580 --> 05:29.780
They're quite complicated to make.

05:29.860 --> 05:31.140
The techniques
are hard to learn and remember.

05:32.380 --> 05:33.140
Just teach me, miss.

05:33.620 --> 05:34.180
I'll remember

05:34.660 --> 05:35.220
and learn how to make it.

05:35.860 --> 05:36.820
Well...

05:50.780 --> 05:51.700
Are you resting, my lady?

05:52.540 --> 05:53.180
What is it?

05:55.340 --> 05:56.660
I've come to apologize to you.

05:59.340 --> 05:59.860
Come in.

06:10.420 --> 06:12.140
You really know
when to swallow your pride.

06:13.340 --> 06:14.700
I slapped you this morning,

06:15.420 --> 06:16.380
and by tonight, you're over it?

06:18.100 --> 06:18.780
Not over it.

06:19.460 --> 06:20.060
I understand now.

06:21.220 --> 06:23.580
That rouge must've meant a lot to you.

06:24.420 --> 06:25.540
I can't truly understand how you feel.

06:27.060 --> 06:27.540
This morning,

06:28.100 --> 06:29.460
you weren't just angry.

06:30.180 --> 06:30.900
You were hurt, too.

06:32.820 --> 06:33.740
Why are you telling me all this?

06:35.340 --> 06:36.620
Want another slap?

06:46.700 --> 06:47.220
What's this?

06:48.180 --> 06:49.100
Tools for making rouge.

06:49.860 --> 06:51.060
I remember the shade of that rouge.

06:51.940 --> 06:52.860
It was the color of crimson clouds.

06:53.860 --> 06:54.460
I want to try making some

06:55.180 --> 06:55.860
and make you a new box of rouge.

07:00.220 --> 07:01.180
You know how to make rouge?

07:20.700 --> 07:24.840
♪The midsummer breeze
blows soft and sweet♪

07:24.840 --> 07:29.140
♪Fireflies dance freely
through the night♪

07:29.260 --> 07:32.980
♪Chasing the beauty
of this fleeting world♪

07:32.980 --> 07:37.500
♪A thousand lights turn night into day♪

07:37.580 --> 07:41.440
♪Cicada songs mingle with the wine♪

07:41.440 --> 07:45.900
♪Their songs linger
through the passing years♪

07:46.300 --> 07:50.320
♪Life is but a fleeting stay♪

07:50.320 --> 07:54.100
♪How lucky I am to walk this path
with you♪

07:54.860 --> 07:59.040
♪Playing out life's game,
forever by your side♪

07:59.040 --> 08:02.980
♪Innocent through the years♪

08:03.460 --> 08:06.980
♪I thought time might stand still♪

08:06.980 --> 08:10.860
♪Forever at that crossroads♪

08:11.980 --> 08:15.620
♪Watching flowers bloom and fade♪

08:15.700 --> 08:19.700
♪Weathering life's rise and fall♪

08:20.380 --> 08:24.300
♪Turns out, unspoken tenderness♪

08:24.300 --> 08:28.540
♪Is starlight caught in your eyes♪

08:33.780 --> 08:34.100
Is it right?

08:34.700 --> 08:35.060
It's close.

08:35.660 --> 08:36.220
Very close.

09:05.180 --> 09:05.540
No, that's not right.

09:06.420 --> 09:07.740
The shade is a little too light.

09:09.540 --> 09:09.860
No.

09:12.260 --> 09:13.820
When it was freshly made,

09:15.140 --> 09:16.180
it was exactly this color.

09:21.580 --> 09:23.020
The rouge that was destroyed

09:25.540 --> 09:26.500
was made by my mother

09:28.260 --> 09:29.620
with her own hands.

09:31.820 --> 09:32.940
It was the only keepsake

09:34.660 --> 09:35.780
she left me.

09:46.660 --> 09:47.180
Yan Shang,

09:47.940 --> 09:48.540
thank you.

09:49.700 --> 09:50.940
How can I ever thank you?

09:59.260 --> 10:00.180
Don't rush to answer.

10:01.180 --> 10:02.100
Give it some thought.

10:20.940 --> 10:21.620
What happened

10:22.300 --> 10:23.220
to your face?

10:27.460 --> 10:28.260
A branch scratched me.

10:29.380 --> 10:29.740
No.

10:30.620 --> 10:31.580
It's a whip mark.

10:32.900 --> 10:34.140
Again, you're not telling me the truth.

10:39.820 --> 10:40.700
I ran into someone

10:41.660 --> 10:42.220
on the road today.

10:43.580 --> 10:44.700
He whipped me once.

10:51.460 --> 10:52.300
Does it still hurt?

11:17.540 --> 11:18.140
It's late.

11:19.980 --> 11:20.460
My lady,

11:22.260 --> 11:23.020
you should get some rest.

11:42.060 --> 11:42.980
You're finally back, huh?

11:47.140 --> 11:48.300
Why are you still awake, Father?

11:48.420 --> 11:49.500
You're still awake too, aren't you?

11:51.260 --> 11:53.460
Busy making rouge for that woman.

12:35.060 --> 12:36.940
You grew up steeped in books,

12:37.860 --> 12:40.220
yet you fawn over that woman.

12:40.500 --> 12:41.740
Have you no shame?

12:50.540 --> 12:50.860
Yes.

12:52.380 --> 12:53.420
I am fawning over her.

12:56.660 --> 12:57.020
You...

12:58.860 --> 13:00.220
Have you no shame?

13:04.020 --> 13:04.420
Father,

13:05.940 --> 13:06.820
I want to leave here

13:07.660 --> 13:08.300
and go to Sheng'an.

13:08.980 --> 13:09.900
She's an honored guest from Sheng'an.

13:09.900 --> 13:11.100
She can give me that opportunity.

13:32.020 --> 13:33.980
You're nothing but a country bumpkin.

13:35.420 --> 13:37.900
You think you'll make a name
for yourself in Sheng'an?

13:40.060 --> 13:41.460
You think groveling at her feet

13:41.460 --> 13:42.700
will send you soaring through the ranks?

13:48.620 --> 13:50.060
It's better than doing nothing.

13:50.900 --> 13:52.220
Better than
pretending to live in seclusion

13:53.060 --> 13:54.140
when you're really just running away.

13:54.500 --> 13:55.700
Better than living like you,

13:56.820 --> 13:58.500
hiding in this wretched backwater
your whole life,

13:58.500 --> 13:59.940
shutting out the world like a coward!

14:08.620 --> 14:09.060
Get out!

14:10.100 --> 14:10.460
Father,

14:11.380 --> 14:12.060
don't be angry.

14:12.340 --> 14:13.340
Shang isn't like that.

14:13.340 --> 14:13.780
Silence!

14:14.740 --> 14:16.140
Want to get out with him too?

14:24.500 --> 14:25.020
Shang...

15:26.860 --> 15:27.300
Brother.

15:30.060 --> 15:30.500
What's wrong?

15:41.340 --> 15:41.740
Thank you.

15:44.820 --> 15:47.220
Brother, why do you suddenly
want to go to Sheng'an?

15:47.860 --> 15:48.740
It's not like you.

15:51.820 --> 15:52.700
What am I like, then?

15:55.100 --> 15:55.780
You're clever

15:56.340 --> 15:57.380
but stubborn to a fault.

15:58.100 --> 15:58.860
You're even-tempered,

15:59.300 --> 16:00.100
yet you worry too much.

16:01.060 --> 16:02.500
You seem to want nothing,

16:02.700 --> 16:03.900
yet something weighs on your mind.

16:04.860 --> 16:07.100
And I don't know what it is.

16:10.140 --> 16:10.620
Xiaozhou,

16:11.700 --> 16:12.380
if one day

16:12.940 --> 16:13.860
I leave Lingnan,

16:14.740 --> 16:15.980
the whole family
will be counting on you.

16:16.220 --> 16:16.940
You're leaving?

16:19.900 --> 16:21.700
If anyone comes
looking for the lady later,

16:21.860 --> 16:22.460
whatever they ask,

16:22.740 --> 16:23.420
just say you don't know.

16:25.260 --> 16:25.580
All right.

16:26.260 --> 16:26.700
I understand.

16:31.740 --> 16:32.500
The officers have been searching

16:32.500 --> 16:33.940
all over the hills since early morning.

16:34.460 --> 16:35.700
They'll probably find this place soon.

16:36.340 --> 16:36.700
Your Highness,

16:37.260 --> 16:38.260
something about this doesn't add up.

16:38.820 --> 16:39.700
Lingnan is full of hills and forests.

16:40.180 --> 16:41.100
We've already hidden ourselves here.

16:41.460 --> 16:42.260
How did they find us again?

16:42.900 --> 16:44.980
Those men are like flies.

16:45.620 --> 16:46.420
You can't get rid of them.

16:46.820 --> 16:47.260
Shall we see them?

16:47.740 --> 16:48.260
No.

16:48.540 --> 16:48.820
All right.

16:49.220 --> 16:49.980
I'll move the carriage.

16:57.540 --> 16:57.900
Your Honor,

16:58.180 --> 16:58.460
over there!

16:58.900 --> 16:59.740
There's a house over there, too!

17:01.300 --> 17:01.820
Careful.

17:10.540 --> 17:11.140
Anyone home?

17:18.300 --> 17:20.020
I'm Zheng Chengqing,
magistrate of Santu County.

17:21.060 --> 17:21.540
Sorry to intrude.

17:31.540 --> 17:32.060
Young man,

17:32.700 --> 17:34.580
is there an honored guest staying here?

17:35.460 --> 17:35.780
Yes.

17:36.620 --> 17:38.260
But the lady left this morning.

17:38.860 --> 17:39.540
If you don't believe me,

17:40.260 --> 17:41.940
check the carriage tracks at my door.

17:47.660 --> 17:48.060
Your Honor!

17:48.620 --> 17:48.900
There...

17:49.340 --> 17:50.260
there are carriage tracks!

17:56.300 --> 17:57.700
After crossing all these hills,

17:57.700 --> 17:58.620
we finally found this place,

17:59.420 --> 18:00.380
only to be one step too late.

18:07.700 --> 18:08.620
Your Honor, have some water.

18:09.180 --> 18:09.820
No, no.

18:10.700 --> 18:11.460
Chengqing!

18:16.540 --> 18:17.700
Chengqing.

18:20.500 --> 18:21.300
Careful.

18:30.940 --> 18:31.980
Yan Zhanzhi!

18:32.260 --> 18:34.300
Chengqing, after decades apart,

18:34.300 --> 18:35.540
I never imagined

18:35.660 --> 18:37.220
we'd live to meet again.

18:45.340 --> 18:46.020
Zhanzhi,

18:47.020 --> 18:48.580
I never thought we'd meet again either.

18:49.740 --> 18:51.900
Back then, you were renowned
throughout the capital.

18:52.300 --> 18:55.260
Your talent far surpassed ours.

18:56.580 --> 18:57.420
(So his father)

18:57.820 --> 19:00.260
(is Yan Zhanzhi,
the famous scholar of his day.)

19:01.420 --> 19:03.300
(Back then, he placed third
in the palace exam,)

19:03.740 --> 19:05.060
(and married a noble lady
of the Xie family.)

19:05.740 --> 19:06.540
(Now...)

19:07.060 --> 19:08.300
(he's ended up in Lingnan.)

19:08.740 --> 19:09.740
To be frank,

19:10.420 --> 19:12.940
my son is now registered
in the Capital Prefecture

19:13.540 --> 19:14.740
and is preparing for the imperial exams.

19:15.300 --> 19:16.300
Look at your sons.

19:17.380 --> 19:19.180
They've become nothing
but country bumpkins!

19:20.900 --> 19:21.540
Then again,

19:22.140 --> 19:23.980
your whole family ended up here,

19:23.980 --> 19:25.060
without household registration
all these years, right?

19:25.660 --> 19:26.940
So you can't sit for the imperial exams.

19:29.740 --> 19:30.060
Father.

19:30.860 --> 19:31.140
Father.

19:31.340 --> 19:32.220
- How did I not notice?
- Easy.

19:32.220 --> 19:33.420
You're paralyzed!

19:34.100 --> 19:36.020
You're not even whole anymore.

19:36.460 --> 19:37.740
You smug little upstart!

19:39.380 --> 19:39.900
Chengqing!

19:40.300 --> 19:40.620
Brother.

19:40.620 --> 19:41.700
- You...
- Take Father back to his room to rest.

19:41.700 --> 19:42.140
- All right.
- Father!

19:42.140 --> 19:42.780
I'll see to Uncle Zheng.

19:42.780 --> 19:43.140
Father!

19:43.700 --> 19:44.100
Shang!

19:44.180 --> 19:44.860
Xiaozhou, go back, too.

19:44.900 --> 19:46.180
- What a hypocrite!
- Father!

19:46.180 --> 19:46.540
Steady now.

19:46.540 --> 19:47.340
You contemptible wretch,

19:47.460 --> 19:49.060
always currying favor with the powerful!

19:49.060 --> 19:49.740
Enough, Father.

19:49.820 --> 19:50.820
You hypocrite!

19:50.820 --> 19:51.540
Say no more.

19:51.540 --> 19:53.300
You hypocrite!

19:56.780 --> 19:58.580
You'll meet a bad end!

19:58.820 --> 19:59.620
Uncle, I'm sorry about that.

20:02.740 --> 20:04.060
You're over fifty now, aren't you?

20:05.540 --> 20:06.580
And you've become a county magistrate.

20:07.260 --> 20:08.980
They say success comes to the young.

20:09.380 --> 20:09.980
But I don't think so.

20:11.100 --> 20:12.740
Take you, for example.
You're no longer young,

20:13.380 --> 20:13.900
yet you've finally found success.

20:14.500 --> 20:15.620
Shouldn't we congratulate you?

20:17.220 --> 20:17.980
Congratulations!

20:23.300 --> 20:24.300
Who do you think you are?

20:24.860 --> 20:26.260
A family of unregistered vagrants!

20:27.940 --> 20:28.700
Uncle, you're right.

20:29.540 --> 20:30.540
We're indeed wanderers

20:30.980 --> 20:31.780
under no one's jurisdiction.

20:32.740 --> 20:34.300
But you're an official now,

20:34.820 --> 20:36.220
subject to the court's
annual evaluations.

20:37.620 --> 20:39.980
You'd best not associate with us

20:39.980 --> 20:40.820
country bumpkins.

20:41.700 --> 20:43.380
Wouldn't want to tarnish
your reputation as an official.

20:50.460 --> 20:51.100
Safe travels, Uncle.

20:53.900 --> 20:55.740
Wait, what are you up to?

20:55.940 --> 20:57.260
You swore up and down
and brought us here.

20:57.580 --> 20:58.300
How dare you make a fool of me?

21:01.300 --> 21:01.700
Sir,

21:02.620 --> 21:04.180
your magistrate is long gone.

21:14.700 --> 21:15.780
So you led them here?

21:48.700 --> 21:49.420
So,

21:50.820 --> 21:51.780
you know who I am.

21:53.460 --> 21:54.140
I was only guessing.

21:56.540 --> 21:57.700
You're that scared of me?

21:58.660 --> 21:59.620
That sick of me?

22:00.660 --> 22:02.300
So afraid I'll stay one more day

22:03.220 --> 22:04.860
that you're racking your brains
to get rid of me?

22:05.460 --> 22:05.940
Yan Shang,

22:06.780 --> 22:08.300
you've got some nerve!

22:09.780 --> 22:11.540
No one's ever dared treat me this way.

22:14.660 --> 22:15.140
I'm sorry.

22:16.340 --> 22:17.500
I was already regretting it yesterday.

22:17.940 --> 22:18.980
Your regret means nothing to me!

22:23.300 --> 22:24.620
For the sake of this box of rouge,

22:27.020 --> 22:27.780
I'll forgive you.

22:28.620 --> 22:29.140
And what's more,

22:30.020 --> 22:30.940
I'll grant your wish.

22:36.620 --> 22:37.020
Chunhua.

22:37.580 --> 22:39.140
Tell them to pack and prepare to leave.

23:41.940 --> 23:42.700
Now I understand

23:43.860 --> 23:46.380
why you want to leave Lingnan.

23:50.220 --> 23:50.620
Father...

23:55.420 --> 23:56.820
You were right that night.

23:58.980 --> 24:00.220
I've hidden away here for years,

24:01.700 --> 24:03.020
as good as dead.

24:04.540 --> 24:06.540
Dalang is simple-minded now

24:07.380 --> 24:09.340
and is destined to live out his days
in the countryside.

24:11.260 --> 24:12.380
As your father,

24:14.140 --> 24:16.100
I've failed you both.

24:18.860 --> 24:20.100
And Xiaozhou has had a hard time, too.

24:30.180 --> 24:30.580
Father,

24:31.340 --> 24:32.580
actually, I envy my elder brother.

24:34.380 --> 24:35.180
He told me

24:36.620 --> 24:38.020
when the rice ears emerge,

24:38.700 --> 24:39.260
he's happy.

24:40.420 --> 24:41.380
Happy when it rains

24:41.740 --> 24:42.300
and cools down.

24:43.860 --> 24:45.020
Happy when Xiaozhou

24:46.020 --> 24:46.740
cooks something good.

24:48.540 --> 24:49.060
Once,

24:49.780 --> 24:51.580
he caught a beautiful dragonfly for me

24:53.100 --> 24:54.100
and was happy for ages.

24:56.580 --> 24:57.900
To eat one's fill and roam freely.

24:59.300 --> 25:01.660
That's the ideal
the sage Zhuangzi pursued all his life.

25:02.660 --> 25:03.540
My elder brother has achieved it.

25:09.940 --> 25:10.740
I'm far from his equal.

25:12.380 --> 25:13.460
With desires in my heart,

25:14.500 --> 25:15.460
I only torment myself.

25:25.220 --> 25:26.740
With the talent to achieve great things,

25:27.980 --> 25:29.700
how can you not aspire
to soar like a roc?

25:30.740 --> 25:31.700
Sheng'an may be far away,

25:32.740 --> 25:33.460
but you can make it there.

25:37.100 --> 25:38.460
You've thought this through
better than I have.

25:40.060 --> 25:40.900
Whatever you want to do,

25:43.140 --> 25:43.820
go ahead and do it.

26:03.020 --> 26:03.580
(I wonder)

26:05.020 --> 26:06.220
(where she is now.)

26:13.060 --> 26:14.580
So much for Lingxi's fine wine.

26:14.860 --> 26:15.580
It's nothing special.

26:23.420 --> 26:24.420
My lady, headache again?

26:25.180 --> 26:26.300
Did you sleep poorly last night?

26:40.500 --> 26:41.060
What's wrong?

26:41.700 --> 26:42.580
My lady, don't get out.

26:43.380 --> 26:44.260
There seems to be a wild beast nearby.

26:58.460 --> 26:58.940
(Watch out!)

26:58.940 --> 26:59.460
(Watch out!)

26:59.460 --> 27:00.220
(Hold the carriage steady!)

27:00.300 --> 27:00.700
(Back away!)

27:00.700 --> 27:01.180
(Watch out!)

27:02.820 --> 27:03.300
Your Highness!

27:03.340 --> 27:03.980
Your Highness!

28:23.780 --> 28:24.220
I'm fine.

28:27.580 --> 28:27.900
It's nothing.

28:28.300 --> 28:29.220
When the tutor asks about it later,

28:29.420 --> 28:29.820
just say

28:30.260 --> 28:31.420
his cat broke it.

28:33.660 --> 28:34.340
(Diligent Study, Steadfast Practice)
What happened just now?

28:35.820 --> 28:36.340
Nothing.

28:36.860 --> 28:38.380
My heart suddenly skipped a beat.

28:39.220 --> 28:40.220
Perhaps I didn't sleep well last night.

28:40.580 --> 28:44.460
(Learning without thought is labor lost;
thought without learning is perilous.)

28:44.460 --> 28:44.900
Shang,

28:45.700 --> 28:46.460
am I seeing things?

28:47.060 --> 28:48.820
If I didn't know you were a bachelor,

28:49.740 --> 28:52.100
I'd think
you'd been mooning over a girl all day.

28:54.460 --> 28:55.580
The results are posted tomorrow.

28:55.980 --> 28:56.660
At a time like this,

28:57.060 --> 28:58.300
you still have time to tease me.

28:59.140 --> 28:59.900
It's only the local qualifying exam.

29:00.300 --> 29:01.100
It's not worth worrying over.

29:02.180 --> 29:03.340
My name will definitely

29:04.380 --> 29:05.100
be on the list.

29:07.420 --> 29:07.820
That's true.

29:08.780 --> 29:09.180
When it comes

29:09.740 --> 29:11.020
to poetry and rhapsody, classical
interpretation, or policy essays,

29:11.980 --> 29:13.340
no one can match you.

29:13.780 --> 29:15.060
Even if Lingnan selects
only one candidate,

29:15.660 --> 29:16.340
it'll surely be you.

29:18.820 --> 29:19.180
Shang,

29:19.940 --> 29:20.300
you're wrong.

29:20.780 --> 29:21.940
(Diligent Study, Steadfast Practice)
The people in these schools

29:22.100 --> 29:23.700
are all mediocre nobodies.

29:24.020 --> 29:25.340
They're not even worth comparing to me.

29:25.820 --> 29:27.100
But in classical interpretation
and policy essays,

29:27.620 --> 29:28.580
isn't there someone right here

29:29.300 --> 29:30.380
who can match me?

29:30.860 --> 29:32.300
If only you had
household registration...

29:36.460 --> 29:37.300
Well, Wenji,

29:38.060 --> 29:39.260
you know every subject there is

29:39.500 --> 29:40.100
except common decency.

29:40.700 --> 29:41.380
A few words in,

29:42.060 --> 29:43.180
and you're already reopening
my old wounds.

29:47.940 --> 29:48.660
There'll be a way.

29:53.700 --> 29:54.380
That's right.

29:56.180 --> 29:57.260
There'll be a way.

30:06.020 --> 30:06.420
(Your Highness?)

30:06.620 --> 30:07.500
(Find the Princess!)

30:07.700 --> 30:08.260
(Your Highness?)

30:09.260 --> 30:09.780
(Your Highness?)

30:17.260 --> 30:18.020
(Your Highness?)

30:18.020 --> 30:18.540
(Come on, pull!)

30:18.860 --> 30:19.140
(Come on!)

30:19.300 --> 30:20.580
(Over here! Two more people!)

30:20.580 --> 30:21.700
- (Your Highness?)
- (Your Highness?)

30:21.700 --> 30:22.220
(Hurry!)

30:22.460 --> 30:22.820
(Your Highness?)

30:22.820 --> 30:23.540
My lady said...

30:23.620 --> 30:23.980
(Your Highness?)

30:23.980 --> 30:25.220
we mustn't call her that out here.

30:25.220 --> 30:25.780
(Your Highness?)

30:26.260 --> 30:26.940
(To the left! Hurry!)

30:27.100 --> 30:27.900
- (My lady?)
- (My lady?)

30:28.660 --> 30:29.900
- (My lady?)
- (Where are you?)

30:29.900 --> 30:30.460
(My lady?)

30:30.700 --> 30:31.460
(My lady?)

30:31.460 --> 30:31.980
(Search over there!)

30:31.980 --> 30:32.540
Fang Tong,

30:33.460 --> 30:34.460
what do we do?

30:35.020 --> 30:35.340
No.

30:35.340 --> 30:36.020
(Come on!)

30:36.300 --> 30:36.940
We must notify the authorities

30:37.420 --> 30:38.260
and get more people to help search.

30:38.780 --> 30:39.700
But my lady forbade it.

30:40.100 --> 30:40.420
(Careful!)

30:40.420 --> 30:41.300
As long as we find her,

30:41.660 --> 30:42.620
I'll accept any punishment.

30:42.860 --> 30:43.300
(Everyone, lend a hand!)

30:43.300 --> 30:44.580
We must find her before dark.

30:45.060 --> 30:46.300
Once night falls in these wild woods,

30:46.700 --> 30:47.500
there'll be beasts everywhere.

30:49.140 --> 30:49.700
(Come on, give it here!)

30:49.900 --> 30:51.020
You two, search over there!

30:51.020 --> 30:51.300
(Careful!)

30:51.500 --> 30:51.820
- Yes!
- Yes!

32:12.940 --> 32:13.780
(The carriage fell in.)

32:14.420 --> 32:15.380
(It would've drifted downstream.)

32:16.620 --> 32:17.620
(If I head upstream,)

32:18.700 --> 32:20.220
(I might find where it fell in.)

33:07.900 --> 33:09.260
(My lady?)

33:10.020 --> 33:11.060
(My lady?)

33:11.060 --> 33:11.580
(Search carefully!)

33:12.020 --> 33:12.820
(My lady?)

33:14.020 --> 33:14.380
Sir,

33:14.820 --> 33:15.460
what happened?

33:15.540 --> 33:16.020
We're looking for the lady.

33:16.020 --> 33:17.620
- (My lady?)
- (My lady?)

33:17.700 --> 33:18.980
(My lady?)

33:18.980 --> 33:20.100
(Why don't we check over there?)

33:20.340 --> 33:21.100
- (All right.)
- (No sign of her here!)

33:21.380 --> 33:22.300
My lady?

33:22.300 --> 33:23.380
(My lady?)

33:23.420 --> 33:24.060
- (My lady?)
- (My lady?)

33:24.060 --> 33:26.460
- My lady, where are you?
- (My lady?)

33:26.980 --> 33:27.660
(Hurry! Search carefully!)

33:27.980 --> 33:28.780
(My lady?)

33:28.980 --> 33:29.620
Miss Chunhua!

33:29.620 --> 33:31.100
- (My lady?)
- (My lady?)

33:31.100 --> 33:31.500
What happened?

33:32.540 --> 33:33.260
Where's your lady?

33:33.500 --> 33:34.100
Yan Shang...

33:34.820 --> 33:35.820
(My lady?)

33:35.980 --> 33:37.940
My lady is missing.

33:37.940 --> 33:38.380
Missing?

33:39.140 --> 33:39.700
How did she go missing?

33:39.820 --> 33:41.180
A tiger spooked the horses

33:41.620 --> 33:44.460
and the carriage overturned
and fell into the river...

33:45.580 --> 33:46.460
My lady?

33:47.100 --> 33:47.900
When did this happen?

33:48.660 --> 33:51.060
It's been most of the day.

33:52.980 --> 33:53.940
(My lady?)

33:54.340 --> 33:55.220
(Search thoroughly!)

33:55.220 --> 33:55.940
(Check over there!)

33:55.940 --> 33:56.540
(No slacking off!)

33:57.020 --> 33:57.780
(My lady?)

33:57.780 --> 33:58.100
Sir,

33:58.700 --> 33:59.220
this isn't the way to search.

33:59.220 --> 34:00.380
You again?

34:00.820 --> 34:01.540
It's been hours since the accident.

34:01.660 --> 34:02.460
She's probably injured.

34:02.940 --> 34:03.820
Her voice must be weak.

34:04.380 --> 34:05.460
With everyone shouting at once,

34:05.820 --> 34:07.140
we wouldn't hear her
even if she cried for help.

34:07.620 --> 34:07.980
Besides,

34:08.500 --> 34:09.340
night is falling.

34:09.780 --> 34:10.540
She has no torch.

34:10.780 --> 34:11.780
All this torchlight in our eyes...

34:11.780 --> 34:12.500
My lady?

34:12.500 --> 34:14.140
... will make it even harder
to see through the woods.

34:14.380 --> 34:16.580
Are you telling me how to do my job?

34:17.620 --> 34:19.380
Right now, finding her
is our top priority.

34:19.380 --> 34:19.940
Then move aside!

34:20.300 --> 34:21.260
Don't interfere with official business!

34:21.900 --> 34:23.140
Walk through the woods without a torch?

34:23.140 --> 34:23.940
Do I have a death wish?

34:24.380 --> 34:25.540
Aren't you carrying one yourself?

34:26.100 --> 34:27.020
And you're lecturing me?

34:27.740 --> 34:28.940
Search carefully!

34:29.540 --> 34:30.820
The sooner we find her,

34:31.260 --> 34:32.740
the sooner we can go home!

34:32.740 --> 34:33.260
(Don't die.)

34:33.460 --> 34:33.780
(Yes!)

34:33.860 --> 34:34.460
(My lady?)

34:38.180 --> 34:39.340
(No slacking! Search carefully!)

34:39.340 --> 34:40.100
(My lady?)

34:40.220 --> 34:41.140
(My lady?)

34:41.780 --> 34:42.060
(Hurry!)

34:47.660 --> 34:49.420
- (My lady?)
- (My lady?)

37:43.620 --> 37:44.820
Mother...

37:46.580 --> 37:52.700
♪A daughter ventures forth,
in the name her father gave♪

37:53.100 --> 37:59.100
♪Into savage lands, to tame tigers
and slay wolves♪

37:59.220 --> 37:59.940
Mother...

38:02.140 --> 38:03.060
Mother...

38:03.060 --> 38:06.820
♪The fate is sealed,
a destiny bestowed by Heaven♪

38:07.540 --> 38:11.080
♪When did you decide to defy it,
to change it?♪

38:11.080 --> 38:14.620
♪When did you decide to defy it,
to change it?♪

38:15.260 --> 38:18.740
♪Defy its might,
and the submission it demands♪

38:18.740 --> 38:22.300
♪Defy its might,
and the submission it demands♪

38:22.740 --> 38:23.740
(Wanyao, don't cry.)

38:23.740 --> 38:27.700
♪Defy its scorn,
stain the sky with blood♪

38:27.700 --> 38:28.860
(My Wanyao,)

38:30.340 --> 38:31.540
(you're the bravest, aren't you?)

38:31.540 --> 38:34.060
♪We weren't born for sacrifice.
Love isn't meant for silent suffering♪

38:34.180 --> 38:35.620
♪Nor wed for the sake of any kingdom♪

38:35.620 --> 38:35.940
(Come on.)

38:36.860 --> 38:38.860
♪Cold as a blade,
yet peerless as a bloom♪

38:38.860 --> 38:39.620
(Have a piece of candy.)

38:40.820 --> 38:44.180
♪Who dares make me bow
down in the dust?♪

38:44.300 --> 38:48.420
♪With sacrificed innocence
and a soul snowbound♪

38:48.700 --> 38:51.060
♪If the road is blocked,
I'll fight my way through♪

38:51.260 --> 38:54.260
♪Cut down the crowd,
strike down the proud gods♪

38:54.460 --> 38:57.500
♪Break through Hell's gates♪

38:58.220 --> 39:02.260
♪If I could meet my former self again♪

39:02.780 --> 39:05.580
♪Don't be afraid,
I'll become a demon for you♪

39:05.700 --> 39:11.820
♪Through fire, I'll turn the dark towers
bright as day for you♪

39:12.500 --> 39:16.260
♪Though this world is hard to cross,
I'll lead you through♪

39:16.460 --> 39:19.460
♪I dare face the unknown,
with my sword in hand♪

39:19.740 --> 39:24.500
♪I'll guard my princess,
and keep her tears at bay♪

39:36.900 --> 39:42.420
My lady? My lady?

39:42.420 --> 39:45.220
My lady? My lady?

39:45.220 --> 39:46.460
(We've wasted too much time here.)

39:46.460 --> 39:47.380
(Everyone, search carefully!)

39:47.620 --> 39:48.380
(My lady?)

39:48.380 --> 39:49.340
- (Search carefully!)
- (My lady?)

39:49.780 --> 39:50.580
(My lady?)

39:50.820 --> 39:51.980
(A few of you,
come check over there with me!)

39:51.980 --> 39:53.420
(My lady? My lady?)

39:56.700 --> 39:57.580
(My lady?)

40:30.700 --> 40:31.420
(My lady?)

40:33.620 --> 40:34.860
- (My lady?)
- (Can you hear us?)

40:34.860 --> 40:35.780
(Have you searched over there?)

40:35.900 --> 40:36.940
(My lady?)

40:38.020 --> 40:38.900
(Check over there!)

40:43.660 --> 40:44.540
(My lady?)

40:45.860 --> 40:46.780
(My lady?)

40:46.780 --> 40:47.220
(No sign of her here!)

40:49.620 --> 40:50.700
(My lady?)

40:51.180 --> 40:51.980
I'm here!

40:51.980 --> 40:54.860
My lady? My lady?

40:54.860 --> 40:55.980
I'm here!

40:56.820 --> 40:57.420
(What about over there?)

40:57.900 --> 40:58.740
(No sign of her here!)

40:58.820 --> 40:59.460
(We've searched over there!)

40:59.460 --> 41:00.100
I'm here!

41:00.180 --> 41:00.860
(Can you hear us?)

41:00.860 --> 41:01.700
I'm here!

41:03.380 --> 41:04.500
- (My lady?)
- I'm here...

41:04.860 --> 41:06.260
- (My lady?)
- (My lady?)

41:06.820 --> 41:07.900
I'm here...

41:09.180 --> 41:10.020
I'm here...

41:12.060 --> 41:13.100
(My lady?)

41:13.740 --> 41:14.980
I'm here!

42:07.180 --> 42:11.780
(Next Episode Preview)

42:12.060 --> 42:12.660
I want to take a bath.

42:13.700 --> 42:14.420
Carry me over.

42:18.020 --> 42:18.700
If you leave,

42:19.340 --> 42:20.620
who'll wait on me while I bathe?

42:22.380 --> 42:22.860
Bath powder.

42:28.560 --> 42:31.853
♪Be the ferry
where you wait for the sun♪

42:34.538 --> 42:39.454
♪Be the blue silk
that catches your tears♪

42:41.648 --> 42:47.493
♪Be the sleeve we held,
worn by dust and years♪

42:47.993 --> 42:53.219
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

42:55.988 --> 43:00.779
♪Let me be a captive beast
bound by the same lock as you♪

43:01.615 --> 43:07.694
♪Through trails of mud and blood;
let grief drown in your eyes♪

43:09.495 --> 43:12.645
♪Soar with the wind;
plunge into hellfire as one♪

43:12.645 --> 43:14.293
♪Burning bright as a song♪

43:14.345 --> 43:18.069
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

43:18.447 --> 43:23.113
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

43:23.732 --> 43:27.773
♪If we say forever,
then forever it shall be♪

43:28.264 --> 43:30.379
♪Not a single hour less♪

43:30.419 --> 43:37.365
♪However deep the snow,
I'll wait if you're there♪

43:38.128 --> 43:41.581
♪We'll be gods above,
or wandering souls♪

43:41.761 --> 43:44.906
♪In heaven or the underworld,
you're all I need♪

43:45.345 --> 43:51.982
♪If we can stay, let's return
to the village of our first meeting♪

43:52.379 --> 43:56.893
♪May time be free of fear and pain;
boats rock, lights fade, seasons turn♪

43:56.931 --> 43:59.400
♪You're the only one I need♪

43:59.604 --> 44:06.491
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain,
nothing can break us♪

44:06.803 --> 44:10.074
♪Be mine in this world;
be mine in this life♪

44:10.379 --> 44:13.552
♪My last untouched innocence♪

44:13.876 --> 44:17.302
♪If only we could return
to the village where we first met♪

44:17.535 --> 44:20.760
♪Stay by me; help me forget
the frozen dream of last night♪

44:21.091 --> 44:27.887
♪Fireflies glow, flowers kiss our lips;
just us, through dawn and dusk♪

44:28.256 --> 44:32.822
♪May time be free of fear and pain;
boats rock, lights fade, seasons turn♪

44:32.869 --> 44:35.207
♪You're the only one I need♪

44:35.438 --> 44:42.273
♪By your side, through joy and pain,
is that eternity?♪

44:42.622 --> 44:44.240
♪Till fireworks flood the town♪

44:44.370 --> 44:46.166
♪Till the lake is still and clear♪

44:46.523 --> 44:49.540
♪You're the only one I need♪

44:49.580 --> 44:50.907
(No animals were harmed
or mistreated in production.)
